  "description": "This BlackHeart Road Ti ZIPP Edition is an aero titanium road race bike with a fully integrated cockpit, race geometry, and a pro fit that delivers quick, sharp handling.\nThe frame is updated with 3D-printed touches designed to make it even more easy to live with daily; including a 3D-printed seamless seat tube that allows for 700c x 35mm tire clearance even when running a full fender, bottom bracket with lower relief channel and internally flared chainstay routing port for easy rear brake hose routing, and rear dropouts that clean up the aesthetics of the rear end of the bike.\nThe build features a SRAM Red AXS 2X groupset w/ power meter, Zipp 202 NSW wheels, and Zipp finishing kit.\nIt is assembled to order in Truckee, California, and the frame carries a lifetime warranty.",
